 ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(36{t}^{2}-24t+4)\\text{d}t \\\\  & =[12{t}^{3}-12{t}^{2}+4t]_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =(12-12+4)-0 \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the distance is $d=\\sqrt{4}=2.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256845 #edb/ref 1080 "Impossible to determine" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256845 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256845 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "075ffae1-ea68-5f4d-bb63-f49b56d8e6b0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256900 #edb/ref 1080 "\\sqrt{13}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256900 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256900 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0c2ec8d6-1a05-588c-997f-14cc9bfb0ab8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256950 #edb/ref 1080 "-5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256950 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186256950 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "126a7cd4-67ec-5bc6-9f63-b9d15c490f12" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257032 #edb/ref 1080 "3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257032 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257032 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1e6b1eff-f968-5af6-ab7e-497c5b252f54" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257061 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257061 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257061 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "222f7372-478c-5a27-a063-8b07e8f92f6d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257063 #edb/ref 1080 "-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257063 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257063 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2264d3f3-6ba4-5db9-9859-6e8df205672b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257064 #edb/ref 1080 "-3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257064 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257064 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2271c2f3-6a0e-52db-a073-7c6e91fd8bbd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257111 #edb/ref 1080 "4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186257111 #edb/ref 1082